528
00:28:45.100 --> 00:28:49.080
is that if you're feeling a lot of discomfort

529
00:28:49.080 --> 00:28:54.080
in the reception of the advice,

530
00:28:57.470 --> 00:28:59.870
then you can pretty much be guaranteed

531
00:28:59.870 --> 00:29:02.030
that you are too impulsive.

532
00:29:02.030 --> 00:29:03.500
Yeah, and you could take that as,

533
00:29:03.500 --> 00:29:05.620
oh, that's an interesting piece of information

534
00:29:05.620 --> 00:29:08.534
that I'm feeling that resistance, feeling defensive,

535
00:29:08.534 --> 00:29:10.837
that should tell you something.

536
00:29:10.837 --> 00:29:15.837
And if you're wise you will take that signal

537
00:29:18.420 --> 00:29:20.463
and process it and say, okay,

538
00:29:21.780 --> 00:29:24.770
I'm uncomfortable because my impulse

539
00:29:24.770 --> 00:29:26.820
has already got me moving in this direction

540
00:29:26.820 --> 00:29:28.300
of this choice that I'm making.

541
00:29:28.300 --> 00:29:31.750
And now I've asked somebody to give me their advice

542
00:29:31.750 --> 00:29:35.430
on the choice that I'm already committed to, right.

543
00:29:35.430 --> 00:29:38.750
My impulse is already engaged.

544
00:29:38.750 --> 00:29:42.130
And if that is what is occurring often,

545
00:29:42.130 --> 00:29:45.560
then you have to realize that you need to put more energy

546
00:29:45.560 --> 00:29:47.003
into the other three Is,

547
00:29:47.840 --> 00:29:51.340
the intelligence, the instinct and the intuition.

548
00:29:51.340 --> 00:29:54.600
And you need to draw back a little bit on the impulse

549
00:29:54.600 --> 00:29:57.290
because it's causing you to be uncomfortable

550
00:29:57.290 --> 00:30:01.190
under the influence of the advice

551
00:30:01.190 --> 00:30:04.480
or the suggestions that are coming from the witness.

552
00:30:04.480 --> 00:30:08.999
Be it a sponsor, a therapist, however it is.

553
00:30:08.999 --> 00:30:13.670
What I learned from a lot, is the three brains,

554
00:30:13.670 --> 00:30:16.954
the head brain, the heart brain and the gut brain,

555
00:30:16.954 --> 00:30:20.260
or embraining as medical science,

556
00:30:20.260 --> 00:30:21.803
multi braining, calls it.

557
00:30:22.793 --> 00:30:27.793
The brain in your heart has to work to serve,

558
00:30:29.140 --> 00:30:31.900
but has to surrender to receive.

559
00:30:31.900 --> 00:30:36.470
So if you sort of take that model and apply it

560
00:30:36.470 --> 00:30:40.390
to how are you gonna receive the advice,

561
00:30:40.390 --> 00:30:42.440
how you're gonna receive the advice of a sponsor,

562
00:30:42.440 --> 00:30:44.863
a therapist, a witness of some form,

563
00:30:46.530 --> 00:30:47.870
you're gonna have to surrender.

564
00:30:47.870 --> 00:30:50.470
And surrender doesn't mean giving up.

565
00:30:50.470 --> 00:30:55.470
Surrender just simply means become inactive for a moment.

566
00:30:56.840 --> 00:30:58.980
It doesn't mean that the momentum is lost,

567
00:30:58.980 --> 00:31:00.770
it doesn't mean that anything is lost.

568
00:31:00.770 --> 00:31:03.250
It doesn't mean that the idea is lost,

569
00:31:03.250 --> 00:31:05.241
but it means stop engaging.

570
00:31:05.241 --> 00:31:06.853
It's like a car.

571
00:31:08.550 --> 00:31:11.670
If you put in the clutch, the engine is still there.

572
00:31:11.670 --> 00:31:13.879
All the horsepower is still there.

573
00:31:13.879 --> 00:31:15.460
The wheels are still there.

574
00:31:15.460 --> 00:31:17.400
The drive column is still,

575
00:31:17.400 --> 00:31:21.873
everything is still there, but it's disengaged for a moment.

576
00:31:22.860 --> 00:31:27.060
And maybe in that disengagement, you will say,

577
00:31:27.060 --> 00:31:31.140
well, I should turn the car to the hard right

578
00:31:31.140 --> 00:31:33.477
because the way I was going

579
00:31:33.477 --> 00:31:35.930
is not gonna have a benevolent outcome

580
00:31:35.930 --> 00:31:38.780
because I've talked to my witnesses,

581
00:31:38.780 --> 00:31:40.104
I've talked to my people

582
00:31:40.104 --> 00:31:43.011
and they're all advising me against this.

583
00:31:43.011 --> 00:31:48.011
Or you may say, I'm good to go.

584
00:31:48.300 --> 00:31:51.333
I'm going to go against all advice,

585
00:31:51.333 --> 00:31:54.692
but I'm going to take full responsibility.

586
00:31:54.692 --> 00:31:59.692
And all of these sort of mimicked sequences, mock sequences,

