00:35:41.700 --> 00:35:44.040
but I'm going to sit with this emotional discomfort

654
00:35:44.040 --> 00:35:46.530
and try to figure out why I'm feeling

655
00:35:46.530 --> 00:35:48.805
the way that I'm feeling right now.

656
00:35:48.805 --> 00:35:52.430
More often than not, that will lead to some epiphany.

657
00:35:52.430 --> 00:35:55.190
Oh, I just had a fight with my spouse 20 minutes ago.

658
00:35:55.190 --> 00:35:58.780
That's why I feel uneasy right now.

659
00:35:58.780 --> 00:36:02.370
And I'm reaching out for this thing that I know will fix me,

660
00:36:02.370 --> 00:36:04.190
at least in the short-term.

661
00:36:04.190 --> 00:36:06.270
I think the ego comes into play as well.

