00:36:08.266 --> 00:36:11.960
I wanna run a marathon, like I've been on the couch,

664
00:36:11.960 --> 00:36:12.930
and I don't like how I feel,

665
00:36:12.930 --> 00:36:14.960
like this is what I'm gonna do.

666
00:36:14.960 --> 00:36:16.520
Like help me figure out how to get there.

