00:36:29.850 --> 00:36:30.790
I just wanna do it.

674
00:36:30.790 --> 00:36:31.881
I've never done anything.

675
00:36:31.881 --> 00:36:33.157
Maybe that's great,

676
00:36:33.157 --> 00:36:37.360
or maybe you're emotionally out of balance

