of a daily reminder or the larger investment

1300
01:09:23.680 --> 01:09:27.020
of of a 16-week, 200-hour course.

1301
01:09:27.020 --> 01:09:28.803
I love the daily emails.

1302
01:09:29.940 --> 01:09:32.550
Sometimes I'm like, another one of these.

1303
01:09:32.550 --> 01:09:33.650
I don't have time to read this.

1304
01:09:33.650 --> 01:09:35.407
I know, and people have told me that.

1305
01:09:35.407 --> 01:09:37.440
And it doesn't hurt my feelings whatsoever,

1306
01:09:37.440 --> 01:09:38.630
But just the fact that it's there-

1307
01:09:38.630 --> 01:09:41.500
I go another one oof these, I don't have time to write it.

1308
01:09:41.500 --> 01:09:42.410
I'm in a bad mood, delete,

1309
01:09:42.410 --> 01:09:44.550
like I just can't do it today.

1310
01:09:44.550 --> 01:09:45.383
I love it-

1311
01:09:45.383 --> 01:09:48.060
You know but the next day there it is,

1312
01:09:48.060 --> 01:09:50.290
just it's always showing up no matter what.

1313
01:09:50.290 --> 01:09:51.470
Isn't that the beauty?

1314
01:09:51.470 --> 01:09:54.000
The beauty of the digital age

1315
01:09:55.050 --> 01:09:58.290
is really more important than the negativity

1316
01:09:58.290 --> 01:10:03.186
of the digital age, because it is so consistent.

1317
01:10:03.186 --> 01:10:06.443
It doesn't have an emotional let down.

1318
01:10:07.570 --> 01:10:08.780
It always shows up.

1319
01:10:08.780 --> 01:10:09.980
Relentless.

1320
01:10:09.980 --> 01:10:11.350
Relentlessly.

1321
01:10:11.350 --> 01:10:13.960
Well, always a treat and a pleasure

1322
01:10:13.960 --> 01:10:15.080
to talk to you, my friend.

1323
01:10:15.080 --> 01:10:17.847
Thank you for gracing us with your presence.

1324
01:10:17.847 --> 01:10:19.130
We'll do it again sometime soon, soon.

1325
01:10:19.130 --> 01:10:21.550
We'll do it again soon.

1326
01:10:21.550 --> 01:10:23.009
And until then-

1327
01:10:23.009 --> 01:10:24.238
Peace.

1328
01:10:24.238 --> 01:10:25.582
Plus.

1329
01:10:25.582 --> 01:10:27.340
Gratitude.

1330
01:10:27.340 --> 01:10:29.030
And take us out with a song.

1331
01:10:29.030 --> 01:10:29.916
Yeah.

1332
01:10:29.916 --> 01:10:30.749
You'll do that again?
I'd love to.

1333
01:10:30.749 --> 01:10:31.740
Cool.

1334
01:10:31.740 --> 01:10:33.070
I'd love to.

1335
01:10:33.070 --> 01:10:33.903
Look at Jason.

1336
01:10:33.903 --> 01:10:35.660
He's all fired up to be a music tech.

1337
01:10:35.660 --> 01:10:36.720
Yeah.

1338
01:10:36.720 --> 01:10:37.781
Guitar tech.

1339
01:10:37.781 --> 01:10:39.810
It's so good.

1340
01:10:39.810 --> 01:10:43.080
Oh, you know, some great friends of mine,

1341
01:10:43.080 --> 01:10:45.660
every Kundalini class ends with this.

1342
01:10:45.660 --> 01:10:48.930
Some great friends of mine and the Incredible String Band

1343
01:10:48.930 --> 01:10:51.200
way back in the 1960s,

1344
01:10:51.200 --> 01:10:55.170
wrote a round, a song in the round, you know,

1345
01:10:55.170 --> 01:11:00.170
and (guitar buzzing) the refrain to it was,

1346
01:11:01.968 --> 01:11:06.968
♪ May the long time sun ♪

1347
01:11:09.415 --> 01:11:14.415
♪ Shine down upon you ♪

1348
01:11:16.774 --> 01:11:21.691
♪ Oh everlasting love and joy surround you ♪

1349
01:11:30.643 --> 01:11:35.643
♪ And the pure light ♪

1350
01:11:38.068 --> 01:11:43.068
♪ The pure light within you ♪

1351
01:11:45.357 --> 01:11:48.956
♪ Guide your way on ♪

1352
01:11:48.956 --> 01:11:53.055
♪ Guide your way on ♪

1353
01:11:53.055 --> 01:11:56.055
♪ Guide your way on ♪

1354
